  "lessons": [
    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-015-THERE-IS-ARE",
      "slug": "eng-a1-015-there-is-are",
      "sortOrder": 150,
      "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-THERE-IS-ARE"],
      "prerequisiteContentKeys": ["ENG-A1-014-PLURALS"],
      "revision": {
        "title": "There is / There are",
        "description": "there is + birlik; there are + ko'plik; inkor shakllari.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nBiror joyda nima **bor**ligini aytish uchun **there is** va **there are** ishlatiladi. O'zbekcha \"...bor\" degani." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida\n\n| Son | Shakl | Misol |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| bitta (birlik) | **There is** (There's) | There is **a book** on the table. |\n| ko'p (ko'plik) | **There are** | There are **five books** on the table. |\n\n**Inkor:** There **isn't** a pen. / There **aren't** any chairs.\n\nMuhim: shakl **keyingi ot**ga qarab tanlanadi — a book → is, five books → are." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- **There is** a cat under the chair.\n- **There is** an apple on the plate.\n- **There are** three windows in the room.\n- **There aren't** any books here.\n- **There is** a school near my house." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-THERE-IS-ARE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ four chairs in the kitchen.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "There is" }, { "id": "b", "text": "There are" }, { "id": "c", "text": "There be" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> Ko'plik ot bilan **there is** emas, **there are** ishlating.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *There is two books.* → To'g'ri: **There are two books.**\n> Noto'g'ri: *There are a cat.* → To'g'ri: **There is a cat.**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-THERE-IS-ARE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ a big tree in the garden.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "There is" }, { "id": "b", "text": "There are" }, { "id": "c", "text": "They are" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-THERE-IS-ARE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ any milk in the fridge. (inkor)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "There isn't" }, { "id": "b", "text": "There aren't" }, { "id": "c", "text": "There not" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-THERE-IS-ARE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ many people at the bus stop.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "There is" }, { "id": "b", "text": "There are" }, { "id": "c", "text": "It is" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-THERE-IS-ARE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ two shops and a cafe on my street.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "There is" }, { "id": "b", "text": "There are" }, { "id": "c", "text": "There has" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-THERE-IS-ARE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ an old bridge in our town.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "There is" }, { "id": "b", "text": "There are" }, { "id": "c", "text": "There am" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Xulosa\n\n- Birlik → **There is**; ko'plik → **There are**.\n- Inkor: **There isn't** / **There aren't**." }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-016-PREP-PLACE",
      "slug": "eng-a1-016-prep-place",
      "sortOrder": 160,
