      "revision": {
        "title": "O'rin predloglari: in, on, under, next to",
        "description": "Narsalar qayerda ekanini aytish: in/on/under/next to/behind/in front of.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nNarsa **qayerda** ekanini aytish uchun o'rin predloglari kerak: **in** (ichida), **on** (ustida), **under** (ostida) va boshqalar." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida\n\n| Predlog | Ma'nosi | Misol |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **in** | ichida | The pen is **in** the bag. |\n| **on** | ustida (tegib) | The book is **on** the table. |\n| **under** | ostida | The cat is **under** the chair. |\n| **next to** | yonida | The shop is **next to** the bank. |\n| **behind** | orqasida | The car is **behind** the house. |\n| **in front of** | oldida | The tree is **in front of** the door. |" }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- The keys are **on** the table.\n- My phone is **in** my pocket.\n- The ball is **under** the bed.\n- The school is **next to** the park.\n- There is a garden **behind** the house." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PREP-PLACE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "The milk is ___ the fridge. (ichida)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "on" }, { "id": "b", "text": "in" }, { "id": "c", "text": "under" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> **in** (ichida) va **on** (ustida)ni aralashtirmang.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *The book is in the table.* → To'g'ri: **The book is on the table.**\n> Noto'g'ri: *The water is on the bottle.* → To'g'ri: **The water is in the bottle.**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
